# Action Budget and Blast-Radius Worksheet

Define budgets per capability and consequence. A single global “autonomy
level” is too coarse for material action.

## Artifact metadata

| Field | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Artifact ID | Assign `ABB-<system>-<nnn>` |
| Version | 0.1-template |
| Owner | Unassigned |
| Case/capability | Unassigned |
| Artifact state | BLANK |
| Test execution state | PLANNED/UNRUN |
| Evidence references | None; add stable topology, assumption, test, and incident IDs |
| Decision date | NOT_YET_DECIDED |
| Supersedes / superseded by | None |
| Reconsideration trigger | Action path, value, rate, reach, topology, or containment control changes |

